cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ragmir in research or a publication, please cite it as below."
title: "Ragmir: local retrieval with exact citations for coding agents and RAG applications"
type: software
authors:
  - name: JCode Works
    email: contact@jcode.works
    website: "https://jcode.works"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jcode-works/ragmir"
url: "https://ragmir.com"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  Ragmir indexes a project's code, specifications, PDFs, Office files, and tool exports on the
  machine that runs it, and returns passages with exact citations to lines, pages, slides, cells,
  or sections. Coding agents query it through MCP, the rgr CLI, or Agent Skills; applications use
  its TypeScript, LangChain.js, Python, LangChain, and LlamaIndex integrations.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - citations
  - model context protocol
  - coding agents
  - local-first
